---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Japan Travel Guides | Pocketey Japan" description="Evergreen Japan travel guides from Pocketey Japan."><section class="container simple"><div class="kicker">Travel guides</div><h1 class="display">Useful before.<br/>Useful during.</h1><p>Evergreen practical guides will live here: trains, eSIMs, airport transfers, accommodation, payments and other topics that help turn news traffic into lasting search value.</p><div class="placeholder">Guide publishing is intentionally kept minimal in the MVP. Add guides once search and audience data reveal the strongest topics.</div></section></BaseLayout>
<style>.simple{padding:85px 0 120px}.simple h1{font-size:clamp(4rem,9vw,8rem);margin:.5rem 0 1.5rem}.simple>p{max-width:700px;color:var(--muted);font-size:1.05rem}.placeholder{margin-top:55px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:25px;max-width:760px;color:var(--muted)}</style>
